      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Man, that feels incredibly isolating, and company employees often sabotage-employees' well-being by targeting personal items to weaken their resolve. While such actions could indicate retaliation, organizations typically use official policy violations or specific performance metrics rather than these subtle, indirect tactics to build a \"performance\" or \"incompatibility\" case. Please do not ignore your safety and consider reporting these incidents to a labor union or a legal expert immediately to protect your rights.",
